/* Gs186: SPHERICAL_SURFACE (radius 5) IS ADVANCED_FACE.face_geometry; PCURVE on seam edge uses V-range [0, pi] instead of ISO-10303-42 §4.4.32 standard [-pi/2, +pi/2] — V-origin offset by +pi/2; wrong V-parametrization maps UV strip to wrong hemisphere (SDHE-12051); shape_null or shape(1) depending on healing */
